# The Bonnie Ship the Diamond: traditional Scottish whaling song (19th century). Shortened to two verses.
# Count 6/8 as two beats: "1 2 3 4 5 6".
{title: The Bonnie Ship the Diamond}
{composer: Traditional (Scotland, whaling song)}
{key: Am}
{tempo: 120}
{time: 6/8}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - U D - U}

{start_of_grid label="Verse"}
